Including the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\arcsin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "cfd5a076-621f-5ff2-8bfa-4fb6302f662b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "cfd5a076-621f-5ff2-8bfa-4fb6302f662b" :question/answer-fields "9e421d13-06fe-576e-a672-4b9b753bec73"] [:db/ensure "cfd5a076-621f-5ff2-8bfa-4fb6302f662b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "cfd5a076-621f-5ff2-8bfa-4fb6302f662b"] [:db/add "679fb1ba-bd34-5411-bed7-a704406519b9" :answer/id #uuid "679fb1ba-bd34-5411-bed7-a704406519b9"] [:db/add "679fb1ba-bd34-5411-bed7-a704406519b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "679fb1ba-bd34-5411-bed7-a704406519b9" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arcsin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{9}+C"] [:db/ensure "679fb1ba-bd34-5411-bed7-a704406519b9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f37f4424-23d9-54fd-ba17-022c88dbf0b7" :answer/id #uuid "f37f4424-23d9-54fd-ba17-022c88dbf0b7"] [:db/add "f37f4424-23d9-54fd-ba17-022c88dbf0b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f37f4424-23d9-54fd-ba17-022c88dbf0b7" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\arcsin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "f37f4424-23d9-54fd-ba17-022c88dbf0b7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2257a5c0-12ee-59bd-bf62-7052ddcbec0f" :answer/id #uuid "2257a5c0-12ee-59bd-bf62-7052ddcbec0f"] [:db/add "2257a5c0-12ee-59bd-bf62-7052ddcbec0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2257a5c0-12ee-59bd-bf62-7052ddcbec0f" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arcsin{\\left(6 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "2257a5c0-12ee-59bd-bf62-7052ddc